<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  One history picker row: the age and which engine produced it on the first
  line, a truncated one-line transcript preview on the second.

  🔴 @drawable/row_bg, NOT the deleted @drawable/history_chip_bg. That drawable
  was a filled PILL, and its own comment argued the fill "because these chips
  float over an arbitrary wallpaper, not over a Dicta surface". In an Activity
  that premise is false: these rows float over a dimmed Dicta surface, which is
  exactly what @drawable/row_bg is the level-1 step for, and it is what
  snip_row.xml already uses. Same shape, same family, one drawable.

  🔴 The transcript is NEVER rendered in full. A dictation is free text and can
  be thousands of characters, so a row showing all of it would be a screenful
  per entry. The truncation is HistoryRow.preview — a character budget, because
  this project's Robolectric cannot measure text and a rendered-width claim
  could therefore be checked nowhere. ellipsize here is the backstop for
  whatever the device does with those characters.

  Deliberately the same two-line shape as snip_row.xml and deliberately NOT the
  same file: the two rows carry different content with different ids, and
  forcing one row type is the coupling FloatingPickerActivity's kdoc declines.
-->
<LinearLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
    android:background="@drawable/row_bg"
    android:layout_marginBottom="6dp"
    android:orientation="vertical"
    android:padding="12dp">

    <TextView
        android:id="@+id/history_row_title"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:ellipsize="end"
        android:maxLines="1"
        android:textColor="@color/dicta_on_surface_variant"
        android:textSize="13sp" />

    <TextView
        android:id="@+id/history_row_preview"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:ellipsize="end"
        android:maxLines="1"
        android:textColor="@color/dicta_on_surface"
        android:textSize="15sp" />
</LinearLayout>
